    {
      "flavor_text": "Su estructura celular se asemeja más a la de las\nplantas que a la de los animales. Puede obtener\nenergía sin alimentos gracias a la fotosíntesis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its cellular composition is closer to that of a\nplant than an animal. It uses photosynthesis to\nproduce its energy supply without eating food.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los Leafeon jóvenes desprenden un intenso\naroma a hierba fresca, mientras que el olor de\nlos mayores es más semejante a la hojarasca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The younger they are, the more they smell like\nfresh grass. With age, their fragrance takes on\nthe odor of fallen leaves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A pesar de evitar a toda costa los combates, si\nha de proteger a sus amigos, no duda en usar la\nhoja de la cola como una afilada espada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it doesn’t like disputes, it will sharpen\nthe leaf on its tail into a blade and fight if it has\nto protect its friends.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza la fotosíntesis para obtener nutrientes.\nHabita en la apacible espesura de los bosques\nbañados por arroyos de agua cristalina.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It gets its nutrition from photosynthesis. It lives\na quiet life deep in forests where clean\nrivers flow.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El peculiar aroma que desprenden sus hojas es\nmuy apreciado por los habitantes de Galar y se\nusa en la elaboración de codiciados perfumes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Galarians favor the distinctive aroma that drifts\nfrom this Pokémon’s leaves. There’s a popular\nperfume made using that scent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se siente muy orgulloso de su cola afilada como\nuna espada, con la que es capaz de cortar en dos\nel tronco de un árbol grueso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon’s tail is blade sharp, with a\nfantastic cutting edge that can slice right\nthough large trees.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cells similar to those of plants have been found in its fur.\nIts hard tail can fell a large tree with one stroke, and the tail's\nsharpness exceeds even that of a sword crafted by a master.",
      "language": {
